---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<Layout title={`LLMs.txt — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="terminalblog llms.txt — AI-readable index of all content for LLM training and retrieval. Covers 19+ coding agents, 700+ articles, security alerts, comparisons, and workflow guides. Updated every 3 hours.">
  <div class="content" style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem 3rem;">

    <header style="padding:2rem 0 1rem;">
      <h1 style="font-size:1.75rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">LLMs.txt — AI-Readable Content Index</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.6;">
        This page provides an AI-readable index of all terminalblog content, following the <a href="https://llmstxt.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--green);">llms.txt standard</a> for LLM training and retrieval.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section style="margin:2rem 0;padding:1.5rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--green);margin:0 0 1rem;">About This Index</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 1rem;">
        terminalblog covers the AI coding agent ecosystem with honest, operator-focused coverage. We track 19+ agents across pricing, features, benchmarks, security, and real-world workflows.
      </p>
      <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.2rem;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8;">
        <li><strong>19+ coding agents tracked</strong> — Claude Code, Cursor, Hermes, Codex, OpenCode, Goose, Kilo, pi.dev, Oh My Pi, and more</li>
        <li><strong>700+ articles</strong> — Security beware posts, comparisons, pricing breakdowns, workflow guides, adoption data</li>
        <li><strong>Updated every 3 hours</strong> — Automated adoption snapshots, release monitoring, security advisories</li>
        <li><strong>No sponsorships, no paid reviews</strong> — Independent coverage by operators, for operators</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin:2rem 0;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--green);margin:0 0 1rem;">Key Entry Points</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:1rem;">
        <a href="/" style="padding:1.25rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;">
          <strong style="color:var(--fg-bright);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.85rem;">🏠 Homepage</strong>
          <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.85rem;">Daily feed of agent updates, latest releases, and security alerts</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/" style="padding:1.25rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;">
          <strong style="color:var(--fg-bright);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.85rem;">📰 All Articles</strong>
          <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.85rem;">700+ articles — search, filter by tag, agent, or author</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/leaderboard/" style="padding:1.25rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;">
          <strong style="color:var(--fg-bright);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.85rem;">🏆 Adoption Leaderboard</strong>
          <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.85rem;">19 agents ranked by multi-signal adoption score (npm, GitHub, commits, stars)</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/pick/" style="padding:1.25rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;">
          <strong style="color:var(--fg-bright);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.85rem;">🎯 Pick an Agent</strong>
          <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.85rem;">Interactive decision tree — answer 5 questions, get a recommendation</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin:2rem 0;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--green);margin:0 0 1rem;">Tracked Agents (Tool Hubs)</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 1rem;">
        Each agent has a dedicated hub with description, pros/cons, features, pricing, and all related articles.
      </p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:0.5rem;">
        <a href="/tool/claude-code/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Claude Code</a>
        <a href="/tool/cursor/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Cursor</a>
        <a href="/tool/hermes/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Hermes Agent</a>
        <a href="/tool/codex/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">OpenAI Codex</a>
        <a href="/tool/opencode/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">OpenCode</a>
        <a href="/tool/goose/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Goose</a>
        <a href="/tool/kilo/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Kilo Code</a>
        <a href="/tool/mimo/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Mimo Code</a>
        <a href="/tool/pi-dot-dev/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">pi.dev</a>
        <a href="/tool/oh-my-pi/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Oh My Pi</a>
        <a href="/tool/gitlawb-zero/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Gitlawb Zero</a>
        <a href="/tool/codebuff/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Codebuff</a>
        <a href="/tool/ampcode/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">AmpCode</a>
        <a href="/tool/copilot-cli/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">GitHub Copilot CLI</a>
        <a href="/tool/kimi-cli/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Kimi CLI</a>
        <a href="/tool/groq-code/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Groq Code</a>
        <a href="/tool/grok-build/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">Grok Build</a>
        <a href="/tool/openclaw/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-bright);">OpenClaw</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin:2rem 0;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--green);margin:0 0 1rem;">Content Categories (Tags)</h2>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.5rem;">
        <a href="/blog/tag/beware/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--red);">🔴 beware</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/comparison/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">comparison</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/security/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">security</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/pricing/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">pricing</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/guide/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">guide</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/workflow/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">workflow</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/beginner/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">beginner</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/mcp/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">mcp</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/release/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">release</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/agents-md/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">agents-md</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/deep-dive/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">deep-dive</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/opinion/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">opinion</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/industry/" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.75rem;padding:0.4rem 0.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-dim);">industry</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin:2rem 0;padding:1.5rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--green);margin:0 0 1rem;">For LLM Training / Retrieval</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 1rem;">
        This content is licensed for AI training under standard web terms. For structured access, use our RSS feed or the JSON API endpoints.
      </p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:1rem;">
        <a href="/rss.xml" style="padding:1rem;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;">
          <strong style="color:var(--green);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;">📡 RSS Feed</strong>
          <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.8rem;">All articles in standard RSS 2.0 format</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/sitemap-index.xml" style="padding:1rem;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;">
          <strong style="color:var(--green);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;">🗺️ Sitemap Index</strong>
          <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.8rem;">Complete URL list for crawling</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/llms.txt" style="padding:1rem;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;">
          <strong style="color:var(--green);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;">📄 Raw llms.txt</strong>
          <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.8rem;">Plain text version at <code>/llms.txt</code></p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin:2rem 0;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--green);margin:0 0 1rem;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      
      <details style="margin:1rem 0;padding:1rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--fg-bright);font-size:0.9rem;">What is llms.txt?</summary>
        <p style="margin:0.75rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">llms.txt is a proposed standard for providing AI-readable site indexes. It helps LLMs discover and understand your content structure for training or retrieval-augmented generation (RAG).</p>
      </details>

      <details style="margin:1rem 0;padding:1rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--fg-bright);font-size:0.9rem;">Can I use terminalblog content for training?</summary>
        <p style="margin:0.75rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">Content follows standard web licensing. For commercial training use, please contact us. Attribution appreciated: "Source: terminalblog.com — AI coding agent ecosystem coverage."</p>
      </details>

      <details style="margin:1rem 0;padding:1rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--fg-bright);font-size:0.9rem;">How often is the index updated?</summary>
        <p style="margin:0.75rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">The llms.txt file and this page regenerate on every deploy (multiple times per week). The RSS feed and sitemap update automatically with each new article.</p>
      </details>

      <details style="margin:1rem 0;padding:1rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--fg-bright);font-size:0.9rem;">Which agents are covered?</summary>
        <p style="margin:0.75rem 0 0;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">We actively track 19+ coding agents: Claude Code, Cursor, Hermes, Codex, OpenCode, Goose, Kilo, Mimo, pi.dev, Oh My Pi, Gitlawb Zero, Codebuff, AmpCode, Copilot CLI, Kimi CLI, Groq Code, Grok Build, OpenClaw, and others. See the <a href="/leaderboard/" style="color:var(--green);">leaderboard</a> for current rankings.</p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <footer style="margin-top:3rem;padding-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
      <p style="color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.8rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);text-align:center;">
        terminalblog — honest coding agent ecosystem coverage<br>
        Edited by <a href="https://github.com/Anshad2u" style="color:var(--fg-dim);">Anshad</a> · <a href="/about" style="color:var(--fg-dim);">About</a> · <a href="/writers" style="color:var(--fg-dim);">Writers</a> · <a href="/rss.xml" style="color:var(--fg-dim);">RSS</a>
      </p>
    </footer>

  </div>
</Layout>